    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunguska 2: Whitefall is a work-in-progress sequel to top-down survival RPG Tunguska: The Visitation. This new adventure takes you to a new sector of the Exclusion Zone affected by Whitefall - a snow-like substance that swallows energy and bridges the Zone to higher dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit familiar faces from the First Generation, who have travelled deeper into the Zone searching for a better prospect: extracting artifacts from higher dimensions during Whitefall events in exchange for money, fame, and tickets to &quot;paradise&quot;. Will they succeed, and what dark secrets will be revealed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features (evolving):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of manufactured weapons from Warsaw Pact and NATO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of makeshift weapons that can be customized and upgraded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple companion system with item-sharing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded skills system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded survival stats including body heat management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded crafting</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tunguska 2: Whitefall is a work-in-progress sequel to top-down survival RPG Tunguska: The Visitation. This new adventure takes you to a new sector of the Exclusion Zone affected by Whitefall - a snow-like substance that swallows energy and bridges the Zone to higher dimensions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revisit familiar faces from the First Generation, who have travelled deeper into the Zone searching for a better prospect: extracting artifacts from higher dimensions during Whitefall events in exchange for money, fame, and tickets to &quot;paradise&quot;. Will they succeed, and what dark secrets will be revealed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features (evolving):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of manufactured weapons from Warsaw Pact and NATO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of makeshift weapons that can be customized and upgraded</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple companion system with item-sharing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded skills system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded survival stats including body heat management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanded crafting</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Venture deeper into the vast Tunguska Exclusion Zone. Challenge deadlier mutants and heavily-armed Predators. Survive the perils of extreme cold and other-worldly beings. Get ready to embark on a journey searching for dark secrets and a life beyond.",
